“The double standard is unmistakable”

 Iran's Foreign Ministry spokesman Baghaei criticizes the IAEA’s double standards in its treatment of Iran and Israel, citing Israel’s nuclear arsenal and the Agency’s failure to explicitly condemn US-Israeli attacks on Iran’s nuclear facilities.

